OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'tortured' by former
OL,4,Apartner, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest into the death of a woman
OL,7,Fwho was found bruised in an overflowing
OL,8,Fbath in 2016 has been told that her
OL,9,Fformer partner "tortured" her both
OL,10,Fphysically and mentally.
OL,12,FLaura Marshall's body was discovered in
OL,13,Fa bath at her home in Victoria Street
OL,14,Fin Lurgan.
OL,16,FIn a statement Laura Marshall's cousin,
OL,17,FDeirdre Toman, told the inquest that
OL,18,FMarshall had told her she was being
OL,19,Fbeaten regularly by her partner Gary
OL,20,FO'Dowd.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
