OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'tortured' by former
OL,4,Apartner, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FGary O'Dowd was arrested and charged
OL,7,Fwith Laura Marshall's murder in 2016.
OL,8,FHe denied any involvement in her death.
OL,9,FTwo years later the case against him
OL,10,Fwas dropped after the Public
OL,11,FProsecution Service (PPS) decided to
OL,12,Fwithdraw all charges.
